# Graphify Default

Unless `graphify off`:

- Check `.cursor/graphify-out/graph.json` freshness when present
- Use hotspot/coupling signals to narrow reads
- Confirm critical claims against real files
- Degrade to targeted semantic search when graph is stale or missing

Graphify narrows scope; it does not replace file evidence.
